    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Result-label mapping",
      "type": "text",
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Only **filegrid_meter_ingest_total{result}** is available for metering. The four result textboxes default to the requested names: created / duplicate / conflict / error. §4 does not define these label values; inspect **All emitted result values** and adjust them to the backend. Counters are aggregated across selected exporters; no meter ID or region labels are invented. These are event rates (per second), not percentages."
      }
    },
